  "description": "One Complete or Frame Per Customer!\n\nDue to the limited stock, we are only offering one bike or frame pr customer, any orders with more than one bike will be cancelled without notice.\n\nA one-off OMNIUM cargo created in collaboration with Cinelli, featuring a custom paint scheme inspired by the legendary Cinelli Laser. The graphic design pays tribute to the bold aesthetic of one of cycling’s most iconic track bikes. Built f rom a unique combination of Columbus and OMNIUM tubing, the frame blends classic Italian steel heritage with modern cargo functionality. A meeting point between utility, craftsmanship and racing design.\n\nLimited to only 120 frames and they are available as either completes or frame kits.\n\nBuilt with a mix of Columbus and Omnium tubing, the frame carries the precision craftsmanship and ride quality that made Columbus a defining part of Italian racing history. Responsive, smooth, and dependable, it gives the bike a lively feel without losing the practicality Omnium bikes are known for.",
